# Provider coding standards

Follow `docs/AGENT_CODING_STANDARDS.md` when editing matched paths.

Quick rules:

- New API methods go in the correct `client_*.go` domain file.
- New resources need manifest entry, docs (`## Import` when adoptable), example, and `TestAcc` coverage.
- Mark secrets `Sensitive`; one-shot deploy flags must not persist as always-true.
- Run `./scripts/verify.sh --quality` before push.
